{
  "slug": "case-study-writing",
  "concept": "Case Study Writing",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "A case study is a published narrative of one customer's outcome with a vendor's product or approach. It is the highest-conversion content asset in B2B marketing because it does the one thing prospects",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A case study is a published narrative of one customer's outcome with a vendor's product or approach. It is the highest-conversion content asset in B2B marketing because it does the one thing prospects most need: prove that a buyer like them succeeded with this solution.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The defining traits of a case study:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Specific, named (or carefully anonymized) customer",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Concrete before/after with quantified outcomes",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "At least one direct quote from a named customer stakeholder",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "A clear narrative arc: Challenge → Solution → Result",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Customer approval in writing before publication",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "A non-marketing tone - the customer is the protagonist, not the vendor",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. Challenge / Solution / Result — the BLUF for customer stories",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Front-load the result. Place the hero metric in the title or subtitle, and again in the first paragraph.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#1-challenge-solution-result-the-bluf-for-customer-stories",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Anonymization decisions",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Name the customer when: Written marketing approval is signed; customer is referenceable; naming helps, not hurts.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#2-anonymization-decisions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Anonymize when: Regulated industry; sensitive admission; customer in quiet period.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#2-anonymization-decisions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Anonymization patterns:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#2-anonymization-decisions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "\"A Fortune 500 financial-services firm headquartered in the U.S. Northeast\" - High trust",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#2-anonymization-decisions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "\"A large healthcare provider\" - Low trust",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#2-anonymization-decisions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. The \"X% improvement\" claim hygiene",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Specific baseline: \"down from 4.2 hours to 12 minutes\" beats \"much faster\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#3-the-x-improvement-claim-hygiene",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Specific time window: \"in the first 90 days\" beats \"over time\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#3-the-x-improvement-claim-hygiene",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Specific scope: \"across 1,200 trades per day\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#3-the-x-improvement-claim-hygiene",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Verifiable source: the customer signed off on this number",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#3-the-x-improvement-claim-hygiene",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Quote integration",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Attributed to a named individual with a title",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#4-quote-integration",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Sounds like a human said it (not vendor-speak)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#4-quote-integration",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Specific, not generic (\"we cut our deploy time in half\" beats \"Acme has been a great partner\")",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#4-quote-integration",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Bad quote: \"Acme is a true partner who has helped us leverage our data to drive transformational outcomes.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#4-quote-integration",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Good quote: \"We used to spend two full days every month reconciling reports. Now it's a 20-minute job for one person.\" - Sarah Chen, Director of Engineering",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#4-quote-integration",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. The written approval workflow",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Customer success identifies a candidate",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#7-the-written-approval-workflow",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Verbal pre-approval from a customer executive",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#7-the-written-approval-workflow",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Draft 1 to the customer",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#7-the-written-approval-workflow",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Customer Legal and PR review",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#7-the-written-approval-workflow",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Final draft + approval signature",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#7-the-written-approval-workflow",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Renewal (annually if case study remains live)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#7-the-written-approval-workflow",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "8. Tone calibration: the customer is the hero",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Vendor-as-hero (anti-pattern): > \"Acme's revolutionary platform transformed BigCo's operations, delivering 73% productivity gains.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#8-tone-calibration-the-customer-is-the-hero",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Customer-as-hero (correct): > \"BigCo's engineering team cut deploy time from 4 hours to 22 minutes by replacing their legacy CI system.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/case-study-writing/#8-tone-calibration-the-customer-is-the-hero",
          "note": null,
